{
  "tema": 5266,
  "slug": "durmio-murio",
  "titulo": "Dormir and morir in the preterite",
  "subtitulo": "El bebé durmió toda la noche.",
  "foto": "t08.jpg",
  "regla": "Dormir and morir change o to u in él/ella/usted and ellos/ustedes in the preterite: durmió, durmieron; murió, murieron. The other forms are regular: dormí, dormiste, dormimos.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Dormir** (_to sleep_) and **morir** (_to die_) use the regular -ir endings in the preterite."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "But in **él / ella / usted** and **ellos / ustedes**, the **o** of the stem becomes **u**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "dormir",
            "morir"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "dormí",
              "morí"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "dormiste",
              "moriste"
            ],
            [
              "él / ella / usted",
              "durmió",
              "murió"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "dormimos",
              "morimos"
            ],
            [
              "ellos / ellas / ustedes",
              "durmieron",
              "murieron"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Don't carry over the present change: there is **no ue** in the preterite (**duermo** today, **dormí** yesterday)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The pronominal forms change too: **se durmió** (_fell asleep_), **se murió** (_died_, very common in Mexico)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: the **u** only goes to the third persons, the ones you talk **about**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "El bebé ==durmió== toda la noche.",
              "en": "The baby slept through the night."
            },
            {
              "es": "Anoche ==dormí== muy mal por el calor.",
              "en": "Last night I slept really badly because of the heat."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Dormiste== bien?",
              "en": "Did you sleep well?"
            },
            {
              "es": "==Dormimos== en la playa, en una casa de campaña.",
              "en": "We slept on the beach, in a tent."
            },
            {
              "es": "Los niños ==se durmieron== en el carro.",
              "en": "The kids fell asleep in the car."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi abuelo ==murió== en 2015.",
              "en": "My grandpa died in 2015."
            },
            {
              "es": "Se me ==murieron== las plantas de albahaca por el sol.",
              "en": "My basil plants died because of the sun."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "pares",
          "lista": [
            {
